  "name": "Dataset for: Scan-to-BIM-to-Sim: Automated reconstruction of digital and simulation models from point clouds with applications on bridges",
  "description": "The dataset consists of raw point cloud data (.pcd file)  of an Aqueduct Bridge obtained through terrestrial laser scanning. The bridge is located on the A38 near the University of Birmingham (C3W6+RX Birmingham) and carries a canal in the centre, allowing pedestrians to pass on both sides.",
